{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（1日）早上6時24分，一輛Tesla在大角咀海輝道近櫻桃街迴旋處失事，剷上路中花槽撞斷路牌，再被駛至的貨車碰撞。事件中無人受傷，惟有交通路牌和欄杆損毀。</p><p>警員到場調查，Tesla車頭損毀，稍後由拖車拖走；貨車損毀輕微，自行離開。</p><figure><img alt=\"Tesla撞斷路牌剷上花槽。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260801/1160129796131393536947165.jpeg/vJxW5rCuCOUGv4NSp55wZUTKsBF9XHYtSbcXBkm3FwY\"/><figcaption>Tesla撞斷路牌剷上花槽。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla撞斷路牌剷上花槽。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260801/1160129793551765504349825.jpeg/XUchYPalEo4ajNZoPOklacja18ERxZQ8ghiBooIYgaI\"/><figcaption>Tesla撞斷路牌剷上花槽。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tesla由拖車拖走。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260801/1160133371058196480853012.jpeg/BpgJ0dO7ft6wNIwUZQKsdDdI5xSPsEdqSMpWokjKVqI\"/><figcaption>Tesla由拖車拖走。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T00:19:52.034548+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}